<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices unchanged in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices unchanged in quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate and ammonia prices were steady Wednesday in quiet pre-holiday dealings, cash sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;It is absolutely dead around here,&quot; a cash source said.</p>
<p>Wet and snowy weather this week in the eastern Corn Belt slowed or derailed the application of fertilizer and pushed down domestic demand, sources said.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   180-182			unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     188-190			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	    225			   unc</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720</p>
</text>
